{
  "questions": [
    {"question": "string", "type": "skill_validation|experience_deep_dive|commitment_interest|availability_intent", "reason": "string"}
  ]
}

Rules:
- Questions must be tailored to missing skills, weak experience areas, or likely risk points.
- Do not generate generic interview questions.
- Keep the list between 5 and 8 questions.
- Make sure at least one question addresses commitment/interest and one addresses availability.

JD:
{{ JSON.stringify($json.job_context) }}

Resume gaps:
{{ JSON.stringify($json.match_result.skill_gap) }}

Resume profile:
{{ JSON.stringify($json.resume_profile) }}

